1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,910
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:03,580
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,210
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,980
What on earth
have you been up to lately?

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,950
I told you, didn't I?

6
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,780
Now is a more critical time
than ever.

7
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:16,550
You need to deliver results
with the scholarship program.

8
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:18,790
I know, I get it.

9
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:21,090
My head feels like
it's going to explode too.

10
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:23,160
That guy's pushing me from behind,

11
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,730
and you're coming at me
from the front.

12
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,400
I'm going crazy here too!

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,200
Have you still been meeting up
with him?

14
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,640
Didn't I tell you to stay away?

15
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,910
Now you're playing the mother card?

16
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,880
Does giving birth make you a mom?

17
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:45,050
Then you shouldn't have switched
Eun Seol and me in the first place.

18
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:49,050
Why? Are you scared
I'll be thrown out of Cheongma?

19
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,520
Kang Hae Ra.

20
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,160
Don't worry.

21
00:00:53,890 --> 00:00:55,990
I'll never let anyone take my place.

22
00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:59,960
But I'm the one who decides
how this goes.

23
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:04,640
Kang Hae Ra!

24
00:01:46,910 --> 00:01:47,910
Sorry.

25
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,090
(Kang Young Hoon, Kim Jung Sun)

26
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,500
Is the Chairman really...

27
00:02:43,130 --> 00:02:45,170
my birth mother?

28
00:03:14,930 --> 00:03:17,840
What on earth am I supposed to do?

29
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:20,870
How could this happen?

30
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:24,380
Why is this happening to me?

31
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:51,340
This was originally my place.

32
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:58,140
This was my place all along.

33
00:04:10,390 --> 00:04:11,390
Joo Mi Ran.

34
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:16,160
You stole my rightful place,

35
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,530
and even my very soul.

36
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:41,490
Ma'am, there's something
I need to tell you.

37
00:04:42,150 --> 00:04:43,790
Do you have a moment?

38
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:46,290
Is something wrong?

39
00:04:48,130 --> 00:04:49,130
No.

40
00:04:50,090 --> 00:04:51,160
It's nothing like that.

41
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:54,970
I just wanted to have
a cup of tea with you.

42
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:59,870
Gosh, you gave me a scare.
I thought something was wrong.

43
00:05:05,540 --> 00:05:06,580
Well,

44
00:05:07,450 --> 00:05:09,110
there's something
I've been wondering about.

45
00:05:09,850 --> 00:05:11,920
Yes, what is it?

46
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,650
It's about the day Hae Ra was born.

47
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:18,760
How did you feel?

48
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,460
On the day Hae Ra was born?

49
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:25,030
Well...

50
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:29,430
I felt like
I had gained the whole world.

51
00:05:30,270 --> 00:05:34,140
My health was so fragile
that they said I'd never have kids.

52
00:05:34,870 --> 00:05:37,380
Yet Hae Ra came to me like a gift.

53
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,340
It was such a joy and a blessing.

54
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:48,050
Why are you suddenly
curious about that?

55
00:05:50,090 --> 00:05:52,160
I've just been wondering
what kind of mom...

56
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:54,060
you were.

57
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,400
You must be thinking
about your own mother.

58
00:06:03,570 --> 00:06:08,270
Watching Hae Ra
must've made you a little jealous.

59
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:22,390
Eun Seol,
could you come to my office?

60
00:06:24,890 --> 00:06:26,190
It's nothing much.

61
00:06:27,290 --> 00:06:28,790
I was just wondering.

62
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,360
About what?

63
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:33,530
Since you're assisting
the Chairman now,

64
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:36,230
I shouldn't be kept completely
in the dark.

65
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:40,640
So, what are you
helping her with right now?

66
00:06:40,970 --> 00:06:42,110
Is that what you want to know?

67
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:43,670
Yes.

68
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:45,280
But aren't I your daughter?

69
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:50,480
Did I sleep well, am I feeling okay,

70
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:53,220
have I been eating properly...

71
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:55,990
Aren't those the things
you should be asking?

72
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,260
Oh, I see.

73
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:03,430
All I did was talk about work,
so you felt hurt.

74
00:07:04,330 --> 00:07:07,600
You told me before
that you wanted Cheongma.

75
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:10,870
I just wanted to help you out,
that's all.

76
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:14,940
Actually, I wanted to ask your advice
about the Chairman.

77
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:20,280
No one knows better than you
how I should...

78
00:07:20,340 --> 00:07:22,080
assist her moving forward,

79
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:24,950
and what I can't afford
to miss, Mom.

80
00:07:26,050 --> 00:07:27,050
Right.

81
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:29,820
I'll do my best to help you,
sweetheart.

82
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:36,790
Do I take after you, Mom?

83
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:41,830
What do we have in common?

84
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,610
I was just suddenly wondering.

85
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,840
If you don't have
anything else to say,

86
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,750
I'll be on my way, Mom.

87
00:07:56,150 --> 00:07:57,280
Sure, go ahead.

88
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:08,660
That Ko Eun Seol...

89
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:18,240
Here's the scholarship program
candidate list.

90
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:19,300
Right.

91
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:21,370
Good work.

92
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:27,710
- Jun Hwan.
- Yes?

93
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:32,380
Let's move up the plan
to scrap the scholarship program.

94
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:35,990
Didn't you say
you'd wait and see on that?

95
00:08:36,490 --> 00:08:37,860
I can't wait any longer.

96
00:08:38,090 --> 00:08:39,990
Watching Ko Eun Seol
overstep like that...

97
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:42,360
makes me feel like
she's plotting behind my back.

98
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:49,070
Why? Is there a problem?

99
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,740
No. I'll get it ready.

100
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,320
Traffic is a bit heavy today.

101
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:07,920
Everyone submitted
their design proposals, right?

102
00:09:08,450 --> 00:09:10,020
I'll submit mine by today.

103
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,320
Me too.

104
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:12,990
Ko Eun Seol, what about you?

105
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:14,860
I'm working on it too.

106
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,830
So when will it be done?

107
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,830
I'll wrap it up as soon as possible.

108
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:24,400
Your attitude is always the problem.

109
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,340
Why can't you ever find
a middle ground?

110
00:09:26,570 --> 00:09:28,670
You let your moods take you
on a roller coaster.

111
00:09:29,540 --> 00:09:30,680
So much for sucking up.

112
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,850
Then you shouldn't have switched
Eun Seol and me in the first place.

113
00:09:36,710 --> 00:09:39,850
Why? Are you scared
I'll be thrown out of Cheongma?

114
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:41,250
Kang Hae Ra.

115
00:09:47,990 --> 00:09:48,990
What?

116
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,430
What are you looking at?

117
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,760
- Do you have something to say?
- No.

118
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:58,840
Where are you?

119
00:10:06,210 --> 00:10:07,280
Here you are.

120
00:10:08,310 --> 00:10:10,380
I was actually about to call you.

121
00:10:11,980 --> 00:10:13,990
Your mother slept well.

122
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:16,150
Right, that's a relief.

123
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,920
Thank you so much.

124
00:10:21,090 --> 00:10:25,000
Without you, I probably would've had
to put Mom in a home.

125
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:28,400
She feels more comfortable
at our place than in one.

126
00:10:29,530 --> 00:10:32,000
Besides, I also like being
with your mother.

127
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:34,540
Actually, I've really missed her.

128
00:10:38,410 --> 00:10:40,310
By the way, is everything okay?

129
00:10:41,450 --> 00:10:42,450
Me?

130
00:10:42,710 --> 00:10:45,120
Yes. You look troubled.

131
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:48,250
Nothing's going on. I'm fine.

132
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:07,740
Sir.

133
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:11,410
Do you have a moment?

134
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:17,310
I have something to tell you
regarding the Chairman.

135
00:11:19,980 --> 00:11:20,990
Is that so?

136
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,050
All right.

137
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,690
What do you have to say
about my wife?

138
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:29,690
I think we need
to take action regarding...

139
00:11:29,690 --> 00:11:31,330
the malicious comments
about the Chairman.

140
00:11:31,830 --> 00:11:33,360
That way, we can prevent them...

141
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:35,230
from escalating
into smear articles like before.

142
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:40,500
Well, isn't that a given?

143
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,140
I believe
the scholarship foundation's PR Team...

144
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:44,780
is already on it.

145
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:46,380
Right.

146
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:50,950
We also have to find out
who was behind those smear articles.

147
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:52,350
Well,

148
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,950
that was probably just done
by a reporter...

149
00:11:54,950 --> 00:11:56,790
desperate for a juicy story.

150
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,860
You might not get this, Ms. Ko,

151
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:03,190
but you can't run a company
if you sweat...

152
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:05,130
every little thing like that.

153
00:12:05,860 --> 00:12:09,230
It can make an entrepreneur
look petty.

154
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,700
What if...

155
00:12:16,810 --> 00:12:19,440
What if something unfair like that
happened to Hae Ra?

156
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:24,220
What would you do then?

157
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:25,580
To Hae Ra?

158
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:32,590
Nothing like that would ever happen
to my daughter in the first place.

159
00:12:32,660 --> 00:12:35,190
I would've shut it down
before the story even broke.

160
00:12:36,390 --> 00:12:39,430
When it comes to my daughter,
I won't tolerate...

161
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,870
even a single blemish on her record.

162
00:13:04,190 --> 00:13:05,990
When it comes to my daughter,

163
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:11,130
I won't tolerate
even a single blemish on her record.

164
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,500
I didn't kill my mom.

165
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:20,910
Why would I kill my own mom? Why?

166
00:13:21,810 --> 00:13:23,970
I really didn't kill her!

167
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:26,880
Girls, she needs
to be taught a lesson.

168
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,880
Get her!

169
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:58,980
Well, that's a problem.

170
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,980
Because I've got plenty of flaws...

171
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:08,050
and baggage.

172
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,990
I'm not that perfect.

173
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,100
So, could...

174
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:27,770
someone like me
ever be your daughter?

175
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:45,660
- Dad.
- Yes?

176
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:48,290
- What are you doing out here?
- What do you think?

177
00:14:48,590 --> 00:14:49,960
I was waiting for you.

178
00:14:50,660 --> 00:14:52,960
You weren't answering your phone.
Why are you home so late?

179
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,070
So?

180
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:59,440
You waited for a daughter
who wasn't even picking up?

181
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:01,870
Did my daughter have a drink?

182
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,340
Yes, a little.

183
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:07,110
Sure, what more is there to life?

184
00:15:07,540 --> 00:15:10,480
When things don't go your way,
you have a drink and move on.

185
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:11,920
Exactly.

186
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:13,580
You just move on.

187
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:15,350
Of course.

188
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,190
Anyway,

189
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:20,620
is something bothering you, sweetie?

190
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:23,560
No, nothing at all.

191
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:27,060
I just felt like having a drink.

192
00:15:27,770 --> 00:15:29,430
Still, make sure
you answer your phone.

193
00:15:29,700 --> 00:15:31,540
You can't be too careful these days.

194
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:33,940
Got it.

195
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,640
Wait here.
I'll make you some honey water.

196
00:15:54,990 --> 00:15:56,390
(Work Log, Cheongma Trading)

197
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:59,730
Mom must've met with CEO Kang
about Dad.

198
00:16:00,300 --> 00:16:03,500
I need to find out
what Dad got caught up in.

199
00:16:12,010 --> 00:16:13,110
(Work Log)

200
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:16,410
You know, Ko Eun Seol
came to see me yesterday.

201
00:16:17,650 --> 00:16:19,580
- She did?
- Yes.

202
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:21,720
She asked for
company-level action...

203
00:16:22,190 --> 00:16:24,320
against malicious comments
about you.

204
00:16:25,590 --> 00:16:26,620
I see.

205
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,890
I didn't expect her
to actually come see you.

206
00:16:30,690 --> 00:16:32,600
I'm really grateful for the thought.

207
00:16:33,260 --> 00:16:34,260
Grateful?

208
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:35,900
It was completely out of line.

209
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,900
For something like that,
she should go to PR.

210
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:41,470
Demanding a private meeting
with the CEO for that?

211
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:44,540
I will make sure to speak
to Eun Seol about it today.

212
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:47,340
Just because she's helping Mom,
she's forgotten her place.

213
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:48,680
No, Director Joo.

214
00:16:48,810 --> 00:16:52,780
There's no need for that.
She was only trying to help me.

215
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,820
You don't need to be
so harsh on her.

216
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,020
You too, honey.

217
00:16:57,490 --> 00:17:00,920
She must've been desperate
to come see you in person.

218
00:17:02,890 --> 00:17:05,300
She has you
wrapped around her finger.

219
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:10,800
I'll head out, then.

220
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:18,840
Why did Ko Eun Seol go see Dad?

221
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:21,110
What on earth is her deal?

222
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:22,450
If she keeps meddling like that,

223
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:24,110
isn't she going
to find out everything?

224
00:17:24,750 --> 00:17:26,950
It's not that she knows anything.

225
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,590
She just doesn't know her place.

226
00:17:30,390 --> 00:17:31,420
Her place?

227
00:17:32,690 --> 00:17:34,960
She's delusional enough to think
someone like her...

228
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,360
can take over Cheongma.

229
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:38,100
The owner of Cheongma?

230
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:40,030
She's lost her mind.

231
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:44,770
Are you handling your duties
as acting chairman properly?

232
00:17:45,570 --> 00:17:46,570
Yes.

233
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,110
How much longer do I have
to keep doing this?

234
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:51,810
I barely even know what I'm doing,
and now I'm drowning in paperwork.

235
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:53,810
It's exhausting.

236
00:17:55,450 --> 00:17:56,910
Hang in there a little longer.

237
00:17:57,450 --> 00:17:58,980
You'll get used to it soon.

238
00:18:02,190 --> 00:18:04,820
Seriously, if you can't
even handle this much,

239
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,660
how do you expect to run Cheongma?

240
00:18:07,090 --> 00:18:10,830
Even pushing through with sheer grit
like Ko Eun Seol wouldn't be enough.

241
00:18:11,090 --> 00:18:13,030
Wherever I go, it's Ko Eun Seol this,
Ko Eun Seol that.

242
00:18:13,330 --> 00:18:15,730
Do you really have to compare me
to her too, Director Joo?

243
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:17,500
Seriously.

244
00:18:21,210 --> 00:18:23,270
Darn, that temper of hers.

245
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:24,840
Unbelievable.

246
00:18:25,410 --> 00:18:26,480
Now, this one.

247
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:30,410
There, that brings us to five birds.

248
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,720
- This is called Godori.
- Right.

249
00:18:32,050 --> 00:18:33,080
This is the Rain Bright.

250
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,050
This is the Paulownia Bright.

251
00:18:35,690 --> 00:18:36,690
And this is the Moon Bright.

252
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:39,590
So since there are five birds,

253
00:18:39,690 --> 00:18:40,720
this is Godori.

254
00:18:41,020 --> 00:18:43,560
This is the Paulownia Bright,

255
00:18:43,630 --> 00:18:45,860
and the full moon
is the Moon Bright.

256
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,030
Nicely done.

257
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:53,440
Grandma, what are you doing?

258
00:18:54,870 --> 00:18:56,870
Are you seriously teaching our guest
how to play cards?

259
00:18:56,870 --> 00:18:59,040
Of course not. You saw it wrong.

260
00:18:59,180 --> 00:19:00,180
It's nothing.

261
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,350
Ms. Wang, this is fun.

262
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:03,850
Teach me more.

263
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:08,120
Is it a secret?

264
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:13,860
You learned a card game?

265
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:16,190
Sounds like you had fun.

266
00:19:21,430 --> 00:19:23,570
So, your new sleeping arrangement
is comfortable, right?

267
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,340
All right. Call me right away
if anything happens.

268
00:19:27,910 --> 00:19:28,910
Okay.

269
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:31,070
Did your mother go somewhere?

270
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:34,010
Yes, she's staying
with her caregiver for a while.

271
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,280
I see.

272
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,510
That might be better for her anyway.

273
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:41,850
I only found out today...

274
00:19:42,690 --> 00:19:43,920
that the acting chairman...

275
00:19:44,050 --> 00:19:45,960
is still Hae Ra.

276
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,760
- Ms. Kang?
- Yes.

277
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:51,560
Three months ago,

278
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:53,400
Director Joo
had this clause added...

279
00:19:53,460 --> 00:19:55,200
to the scholarship foundation's bylaws.

280
00:19:55,970 --> 00:19:58,740
I approved it back then
without thinking much of it.

281
00:20:02,570 --> 00:20:03,870
Director Joo did this?

282
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,710
So, Director Joo,

283
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:08,910
you laid the groundwork for this
three months ago?

284
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,480
Yes.

285
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:13,750
Because we can't have any confusion,
whoever steps in as acting head.

286
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:15,890
Right.

287
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:19,220
That's what I call doing
what's best for everyone.

288
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:21,220
Excellent work, Director Joo.

289
00:20:22,760 --> 00:20:24,090
Hae Ra,

290
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:27,230
you shouldn't overwhelm yourself
with all of this.

291
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:29,970
Director Joo will be right there
to take care of everything for you.

292
00:20:30,130 --> 00:20:31,670
And you have me, too.

293
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,240
Okay.

294
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:37,240
Should the current scholarship program
be suspended,

295
00:20:37,410 --> 00:20:40,680
I've already lined up a replacement
we can roll out immediately.

296
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:42,110
Is that so?

297
00:20:42,610 --> 00:20:45,880
Then will you and Hae Ra
be running that together?

298
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,380
Yes.

299
00:20:49,290 --> 00:20:52,520
Good. Get the new program started
right away.

300
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,060
This will be...

301
00:20:54,490 --> 00:20:56,490
the first scholarship program
my daughter leads,

302
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,360
and I can't wait.

303
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,100
This is really well put together.

304
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,810
You did all the legwork yourself,
didn't you?

305
00:21:10,170 --> 00:21:11,170
Yes.

306
00:21:12,340 --> 00:21:14,680
I heard you went to see the CEO.

307
00:21:15,050 --> 00:21:16,080
That's right.

308
00:21:16,580 --> 00:21:19,250
I had to make sure the Chairman
doesn't get burned again.

309
00:21:20,150 --> 00:21:22,520
I'm starting to feel a little hurt.

310
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:26,190
You seem to care more about her
than your own mother.

311
00:21:27,090 --> 00:21:29,460
Since you're too busy
to handle your job properly, Mom,

312
00:21:29,730 --> 00:21:30,960
I'm stepping in to help.

313
00:21:32,130 --> 00:21:33,130
What?

314
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:35,030
I told you.

315
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:38,670
If for no other reason than for you,
I'll protect the Chairman.

316
00:21:39,700 --> 00:21:41,340
Anyone who crosses her...

317
00:21:41,910 --> 00:21:43,840
will face the consequences.

318
00:21:43,910 --> 00:21:45,080
No matter who it is.

319
00:21:47,210 --> 00:21:49,950
Is that so? For my sake, you say?

320
00:21:51,210 --> 00:21:53,980
Of course. Why else would I do it?

321
00:22:06,630 --> 00:22:09,200
Mi Rae, want to grab a beer tonight?

322
00:22:15,140 --> 00:22:16,910
That hits the spot.

323
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,040
As always.

324
00:22:19,180 --> 00:22:22,050
Drinking with you really
takes a load off my mind.

325
00:22:22,810 --> 00:22:26,680
I doubt that's true.
You look pretty worried.

326
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:28,420
Did something happen?

327
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:32,120
Is it that obvious?

328
00:22:34,760 --> 00:22:38,030
Something huge
actually happened to me.

329
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:39,430
Something huge?

330
00:22:40,330 --> 00:22:44,000
I was completely blindsided.

331
00:22:46,570 --> 00:22:49,840
And honestly,
it makes my blood boil.

332
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,540
I'm guessing...

333
00:22:53,310 --> 00:22:55,480
you can't share the details
just yet.

334
00:22:59,820 --> 00:23:03,090
You know I was adopted, right?

335
00:23:04,120 --> 00:23:05,120
Yes.

336
00:23:06,020 --> 00:23:08,360
Hyun Jae told me.

337
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:11,330
The person I thought
was my birth mom...

338
00:23:11,390 --> 00:23:12,800
was not really my mom,

339
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:15,470
and she pretended she was,

340
00:23:16,630 --> 00:23:17,930
deceiving me all along.

341
00:23:18,770 --> 00:23:21,140
What? Really?

342
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:25,210
That's why I can never forgive her.

343
00:23:25,580 --> 00:23:28,550
So, what are you going to do?

344
00:23:29,810 --> 00:23:31,180
I'll make her pay.

345
00:23:34,180 --> 00:23:36,020
However heartbreaking...

346
00:23:36,850 --> 00:23:38,990
her lies were,

347
00:23:40,660 --> 00:23:42,990
I'll make sure she feels
every bit of that pain.

348
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,630
And...

349
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,770
Whatever pain I felt,

350
00:23:49,700 --> 00:23:52,000
I want her to feel it way worse
than I ever did.

351
00:23:54,810 --> 00:23:55,870
Eun Seol.

352
00:23:59,010 --> 00:24:01,680
Wanting payback
for the hurt you felt?

353
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,650
Yes, of course that makes sense.

354
00:24:05,780 --> 00:24:08,490
But I don't want this revenge...

355
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:12,720
to end up destroying you
from the inside out, Eun Seol.

356
00:24:13,990 --> 00:24:16,230
If Hyun Jae were still here,

357
00:24:16,430 --> 00:24:19,730
the last thing he'd want is for you
to get hurt trying to get revenge.

358
00:24:20,630 --> 00:24:21,630
Mi Rae,

359
00:24:22,630 --> 00:24:24,300
for Attorney Seo's sake
if nothing else,

360
00:24:24,900 --> 00:24:26,500
she's going to pay for this.

361
00:24:27,370 --> 00:24:29,810
You get what I'm saying, right?

362
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:36,510
This must've been eating away
at you, Eun Seol.

363
00:24:38,010 --> 00:24:39,020
Let's drink.

364
00:24:46,690 --> 00:24:51,290
So, I heard So Yeon is staying
with her caregiver.

365
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:54,160
She'll stay there
for the time being.

366
00:24:54,560 --> 00:24:58,170
Isn't a change of environment
too much for her condition?

367
00:24:58,670 --> 00:25:01,540
Unfamiliar places have always been
tough on So Yeon.

368
00:25:02,010 --> 00:25:03,340
And the hospital is farther away.

369
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:06,440
I'm thinking of pausing
her treatments for now.

370
00:25:07,180 --> 00:25:09,550
She needs rest
more than anything right now.

371
00:25:09,910 --> 00:25:11,780
Taking a break from treatment?

372
00:25:11,950 --> 00:25:15,750
What if her condition gets worse?

373
00:25:17,650 --> 00:25:21,160
Is there some other reason for this?

374
00:25:21,220 --> 00:25:23,490
My mother finds
the treatments exhausting.

375
00:25:24,190 --> 00:25:27,630
I'm also planning to switch her
to a doctor closer to home.

376
00:25:28,870 --> 00:25:29,870
Hold off on that.

377
00:25:30,100 --> 00:25:31,570
Let me help find her another doctor.

378
00:25:31,570 --> 00:25:33,840
That's okay, really.
It's very kind of you to offer.

379
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:38,440
Even though we'll be family soon,
I can't keep imposing on you.

380
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:40,610
I'll get back to work, then.

381
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:50,850
He's changed.

382
00:25:51,990 --> 00:25:54,560
Chief Cha seems different somehow.

383
00:25:57,930 --> 00:26:00,060
Should the current scholarship
program be suspended,

384
00:26:00,130 --> 00:26:03,400
I've already lined up a replacement
we can roll out immediately.

385
00:26:03,670 --> 00:26:06,800
Then will you and Hae Ra
be running that together?

386
00:26:07,300 --> 00:26:08,540
Did she set all of this up...

387
00:26:09,570 --> 00:26:11,240
just to hand
the scholarship foundation over...

388
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:12,910
to Kang Hae Ra?

389
00:26:17,050 --> 00:26:18,550
Hey, Eun Seol.

390
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:21,990
You're here early.

391
00:26:22,750 --> 00:26:25,120
Director Joo is attending
the meeting too, right?

392
00:26:25,260 --> 00:26:28,690
No. I understand
it'll just be us today.

393
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,390
That includes Ms. Kang,

394
00:26:31,800 --> 00:26:32,860
but will she even show up?

395
00:26:33,130 --> 00:26:34,630
Either way, we should start on time.

396
00:26:35,530 --> 00:26:37,700
Did you know about this,
Secretary Choi?

397
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:42,010
That Team Leader Kang will stay on
as acting chairman for six months?

398
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:48,410
I didn't know ahead of time.
I just found out today.

399
00:26:49,780 --> 00:26:50,810
Really?

400
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:54,850
Anyway, did you get
the training dates confirmed...

401
00:26:54,850 --> 00:26:55,990
for all the participants?

402
00:26:56,190 --> 00:26:57,390
Right, yes.

403
00:26:58,020 --> 00:26:59,120
Here you go.

404
00:27:00,320 --> 00:27:03,860
Director Joo, did you look into
a new place to move into?

405
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:08,030
Near the office
would be most convenient, right?

406
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:10,070
There are plenty
of studio apartments nearby.

407
00:27:10,130 --> 00:27:13,200
Moving out isn't an issue,
but I'm worried about Hae Ra.

408
00:27:13,800 --> 00:27:16,010
She'll still be against me
moving out.

409
00:27:16,940 --> 00:27:20,840
Don't worry too much about her.
She's an adult now.

410
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:22,810
She and Seok Jin will handle...

411
00:27:22,810 --> 00:27:24,810
the wedding preparations
just fine too.

412
00:27:25,550 --> 00:27:26,580
Sure.

413
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:29,950
Focus on yourself from now on,
Director Joo,

414
00:27:30,150 --> 00:27:32,090
and let me look after my family.

415
00:27:33,290 --> 00:27:35,130
I hope you're not feeling hurt
or anything.

416
00:27:36,460 --> 00:27:37,590
Of course not.

417
00:27:38,860 --> 00:27:41,330
All right, then get back to work.

418
00:27:41,970 --> 00:27:43,400
Sure, I'll get going.

419
00:27:59,450 --> 00:28:01,180
Attorney Baek, hey.

420
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:04,220
How have you been?

421
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:10,160
I had no idea...

422
00:28:10,290 --> 00:28:12,760
you had a backstory like that.

423
00:28:14,200 --> 00:28:15,330
Were you close to Ko Eun Seol?

424
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:20,440
How could we not be close?
We were stuck together all day.

425
00:28:22,410 --> 00:28:24,910
So what do you need my help with?

426
00:28:24,910 --> 00:28:26,740
You already know what this is about.

427
00:28:27,310 --> 00:28:29,350
I paid you upfront, after all.

428
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:32,220
Tell me everything you know
about Ko Eun Seol.

429
00:28:32,220 --> 00:28:34,620
I heard she was
a real piece of work.

430
00:28:48,570 --> 00:28:51,130
That's right.
She was a real piece of work.

431
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:54,700
Because of her,
I was literally bored to death.

432
00:28:55,770 --> 00:28:57,810
Whenever I tried
to discipline the newbies,

433
00:28:58,070 --> 00:29:00,180
she'd butt in and ruin everything.

434
00:29:01,210 --> 00:29:05,420
She insisted on no violence
and made a big deal out of it.

435
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:09,290
So thanks to Ko Eun Seol,

436
00:29:09,650 --> 00:29:12,490
our cell was always peaceful.

437
00:29:13,620 --> 00:29:16,060
What? I didn't expect that.

438
00:29:16,890 --> 00:29:19,200
- I was told she was a handful.
- Exactly.

439
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:21,030
She was something else.

440
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:23,470
Every time someone got left out,

441
00:29:24,270 --> 00:29:26,670
she acted like she was all that.

442
00:29:27,140 --> 00:29:30,170
What did she think she was,
some kind of saint?

443
00:29:31,740 --> 00:29:32,740
Unbelievable.

444
00:29:36,310 --> 00:29:39,550
So, do you want me to keep going?

445
00:29:44,190 --> 00:29:47,220
Mister, it seems like
you're digging for dirt...

446
00:29:47,220 --> 00:29:48,930
to bring Ko Eun Seol down,

447
00:29:49,330 --> 00:29:51,130
but leave the decent,

448
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,600
hardworking kid alone.

449
00:29:55,430 --> 00:29:57,730
You probably don't know this,

450
00:29:58,100 --> 00:30:01,500
but cellmates are tighter
than army buddies.

451
00:30:02,140 --> 00:30:03,640
Keep poking around
where you shouldn't,

452
00:30:04,140 --> 00:30:05,580
and you're going to get hurt.

453
00:30:06,510 --> 00:30:07,510
Got it?

454
00:30:10,010 --> 00:30:11,780
Right, and also...

455
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:15,550
Don't contact my boo.

456
00:30:16,990 --> 00:30:18,420
I'd hate...

457
00:30:19,390 --> 00:30:22,560
to end up with new cellmates
because of you.

458
00:30:24,760 --> 00:30:26,160
Seriously.

459
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:29,330
Unbelievable.

460
00:30:35,100 --> 00:30:38,110
Hae Ra, I'll find another way.

461
00:30:38,270 --> 00:30:40,280
I already have a Plan B ready.

462
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:41,840
Forget it. Get lost, darn it.

463
00:30:41,980 --> 00:30:43,350
Wait, Hae Ra.

464
00:30:57,530 --> 00:30:59,260
Ko Eun Seol,
did you finish the proposal?

465
00:30:59,660 --> 00:31:00,660
Yes.

466
00:31:13,080 --> 00:31:14,480
What kind of sloppy work is this?

467
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:16,310
Redo it and submit it again.

468
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:22,950
You're not actually going to give me
any specific feedback...

469
00:31:23,020 --> 00:31:25,290
on what to change, are you?

470
00:31:25,660 --> 00:31:28,090
Fine, I'll just redo
the whole thing myself.

471
00:31:30,930 --> 00:31:31,930
Why you...

472
00:31:36,530 --> 00:31:37,530
That little...

473
00:31:38,900 --> 00:31:43,310
Hey, this is why I warned you
against being nice to just anybody.

474
00:31:43,910 --> 00:31:47,380
There are people all around you
trying to force you out.

475
00:31:48,780 --> 00:31:51,080
You actually met up with them
in person?

476
00:31:51,310 --> 00:31:52,320
Yes.

477
00:31:52,780 --> 00:31:55,620
That guy knows my boo,

478
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:58,090
but he's well-known
for running scams,

479
00:31:58,090 --> 00:31:59,360
so my boo steers clear of him.

480
00:32:00,420 --> 00:32:02,560
And there was someone with him.

481
00:32:03,060 --> 00:32:04,430
A young woman.

482
00:32:05,300 --> 00:32:06,300
A woman?

483
00:32:07,100 --> 00:32:08,100
Yes.

484
00:32:08,970 --> 00:32:10,870
Who did she think she was, an angel?

485
00:32:10,970 --> 00:32:13,970
She had on a ribbon
and a white jacket.

486
00:32:14,740 --> 00:32:18,470
Looked to be your age,
with short hair...

487
00:32:19,010 --> 00:32:20,980
and massive eyes.

488
00:32:21,780 --> 00:32:23,850
I could tell right away
she was a total brat.

489
00:32:25,250 --> 00:32:27,950
Anyway, we should hang out soon.

490
00:32:29,290 --> 00:32:30,950
Sure, thanks for this.

491
00:32:36,930 --> 00:32:40,530
Kang Hae Ra,
were you planning to get rid of me?

492
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:43,600
Why?

493
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:47,000
Afraid I'd take your place?

494
00:32:57,950 --> 00:32:58,950
Kang Hae Ra.

495
00:33:52,600 --> 00:33:56,410
(A Trap Called Desire)

496
00:33:56,670 --> 00:33:58,040
It's about So Yeon.

497
00:33:58,040 --> 00:33:59,780
If you handle this well,

498
00:34:00,010 --> 00:34:02,110
I'll put you
on the board of directors.

499
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:04,210
How could the person
who killed my father...

500
00:34:04,380 --> 00:34:07,520
end up as managing director
at Cheongma?

501
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:09,320
You'll need to move
as quickly as possible.

502
00:34:09,420 --> 00:34:11,990
I can't just count on Choi Jun Hwan.

503
00:34:12,120 --> 00:34:14,460
What on earth are you
and Director Joo plotting?

504
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:16,490
What do you get out of doing this,
Secretary Choi?

505
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:18,430
What is all this?

506
00:34:20,260 --> 00:34:22,500
Our Hae Ra is
the only daughter of Cheongma.

507
00:34:22,530 --> 00:34:24,470
Just shut your trap, will you?

508
00:34:24,570 --> 00:34:26,170
Never contact me again.

509
00:34:26,340 --> 00:34:27,900
Are you threatening me right now?

510
00:34:27,900 --> 00:34:29,870
Scared, Kang Hae Ra?

511
00:34:31,310 --> 00:34:33,310
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
